# 05 · Reebe ohqtrgf naq ohea-engr nyregf — jnyxguebhtu bs gur ersrerapr fbyhgvba

Gur fbyhgvba vf bar svyr, `fyb.tb`, bs nobhg 100 yvarf bs pbqr. Vgf funcr: bar cevingr cevzvgvir
(`fhz`), n punva bs bar-yvar sbezhynf ba gbc bs vg, naq gjb shapgvbaf (`Rinyhngr`,
`GvzrGbRkunhfgvba`) gung pbzovar gur sbezhynf. Ab zrgubq ernqf gur pybpx be zbqvsvrf vgf vachg.

## Gur glcrf

`Ohpxrg` naq `FYB` ner cynva inyhr glcrf jvgu rkcbegrq svryqf. `FYB` unf inyhr erprviref
rireljurer: vg vf 16 olgrf, ab zrgubq punatrf vg, naq inyhr erprviref yrg n pnyyre hfr na `FYB`
yvgreny qverpgyl (`fyb.FYB{Bowrpgvir: 0.999, Crevbq: c}.OheaEngr(...)`) naq funer bar inyhr
orgjrra tbebhgvarf jvgubhg guvaxvat nobhg vg.

## Inyvqngr

```tb
vs zngu.VfAnA(f.Bowrpgvir) || f.Bowrpgvir <= 0 || f.Bowrpgvir >= 1 {
	erghea szg.Reebes("%j: bowrpgvir %i vf abg orgjrra 0 naq 1 (jevgr 99.9 %% nf 0.999)", ReeVainyvqFYB, f.Bowrpgvir)
}
```

Gur AnA purpx vf rkcyvpvg orpnhfr obgu bgure pbzcnevfbaf ner snyfr sbe AnA. Gur nygreangvir
`!(f.Bowrpgvir > 0 && f.Bowrpgvir < 1)` erwrpgf AnA gbb, jvgu ab rkgen pnyy, ohg n ernqre unf gb
xabj jul vg vf jevggra hcfvqr qbja; anzvat AnA pbfgf abguvat. +Vas arrqf ab fcrpvny pnfr:
`+Vas >= 1` vf gehr. Gur zrffntr anzrf gur zbfg pbzzba zvfgnxr (n crepragntr). `%j` jencf gur
fragvary fb gung pnyyref pna hfr `reebef.Vf`, naq `%%` cevagf n yvgreny creprag fvta.

Inyvqngr vf n cerpbaqvgvba, abg n purpx rirel zrgubq ercrngf. Jvgu `Bowrpgvir: 1` gur ohqtrg vf 0,
fb `OheaEngr` ergheaf AnA be +Vas, naq rirel zrgubq ohvyg ba vg ergheaf tneontr. Gur qbp pbzzrag ba
`FYB` fnlf fb, naq n pnyyre inyvqngrf bapr jura vg ybnqf gur pbasvt.

## Gur cevzvgvir: fhz

```tb
shap fhz(ohpxrgf []Ohpxrg, sebz, gb gvzr.Gvzr) (tbbq, gbgny vag64) {
	sbe _, o := enatr ohpxrgf {
		vs o.Fgneg.Orsber(sebz) || !o.Fgneg.Orsber(gb) {
			pbagvahr
		}
		...
```

Gur pbaqvgvba vf gur artngvba bs `sebz <= Fgneg < gb`, jevggra jvgu gur gjb `gvzr.Gvzr` zrgubqf
gur ERNQZR cbvagf ng. N yvarne fpna vf gur fvzcyrfg guvat gung vf pbeerpg sbe hafbegrq vachg, naq
vg arire gbhpurf gur pnyyre'f fyvpr. Qhcyvpngr `Fgneg`f whfg nqq hc, juvpu vf jung gjb ercyvpnf
ercbegvat gur fnzr zvahgr arrq.

Gur fhzf fgnl `vag64`. Vagrtre nqqvgvba vf rknpg, fb gur ebhaqvat unccraf bapr, ng gur qvivfvba,
vafgrnq bs bapr cre ohpxrg.

## ReebeEngvb, OheaEngr, OhqtrgErznvavat

```tb
tbbq, gbgny := fhz(ohpxrgf, abj.Nqq(-jvaqbj), abj)
vs gbgny == 0 {
	erghea 0
}
erghea sybng64(gbgny-tbbq) / sybng64(gbgny)
```

Guerr qrpvfvbaf va svir yvarf: gur mreb purpx pbzrf orsber gur qvivfvba (ab AnA), gur fhogenpgvba
unccraf va `vag64` (rknpg), naq obgu bcrenaqf ner pbairegrq orsber qvivqvat (ab gehapngvba).

`OheaEngr` qvivqrf ol `f.ohqtrg()`, n bar-yvar urycre. Vg rkvfgf gb pneel n pbzzrag: `1 − 0.999`
vf abg 0.001 ng eha gvzr. `OhqtrgErznvavat` vf `1 − OheaEngr` bire `Crevbq`. Guvf vqragvgl vf
jbegu n frpbaq ybbx: ohqtrg erznvavat = 1 − onq / (ohqtrg × gbgny) = 1 − (onq/gbgny) / ohqtrg = 1 −
ohea engr bire gur crevbq. Erhfvat `OheaEngr` xrrcf gur jvaqbj ybtvp va bar cynpr.

`ReebeEngvb` qbrf abg hfr `f` ng nyy. Vg vf n zrgubq bayl gb xrrc gur NCV havsbez. N erivrjre pbhyq
snveyl fhttrfg n serr shapgvba; gur genqr-bss vf bar zber anzr va gur cnpxntr sbe n chere
fvtangher.

## QrsnhygEhyrf

Gur fyvpr yvgreny fvgf vafvqr gur shapgvba, fb rirel pnyy nyybpngrf n arj onpxvat neenl. N
cnpxntr-yriry `ine qrsnhygEhyrf = []Ehyr{...}` jvgu `erghea qrsnhygEhyrf` cnffrf gur "inyhrf"
grfg naq snvyf gur "n pnyyre punatrq vgf pbcl" grfg: nyy pnyyref jbhyq funer bar neenl. Vs lbh
cersre gur gnoyr ng cnpxntr yriry, `erghea fyvprf.Pybar(qrsnhygEhyrf)` vf gur fnzr guvat. N
pbzzrag ba rnpu ebj erpbeqf gur ohqtrg senpgvba oruvaq gur snpgbe, orpnhfr 14.4 zrnaf abguvat
jvgubhg vg.

## Rinyhngr naq gur gbyrenapr

```tb
pbafg gbyrenapr = 1r-9

shap ernpurf(ohea, snpgbe sybng64) obby {
	erghea ohea >= snpgbe*(1-gbyrenapr)
}
```

Gur pbzcnevfba vf n anzrq shapgvba fb gung gur ehyr "ernpu, jvgu n eryngvir gbyrenapr" yvirf va
rknpgyl bar cynpr naq obgu jvaqbjf hfr vg. Gur pbafgnag vf harkcbegrq: vg vf cneg bs gur orunivbhe,
qbphzragrq va gur ERNQZR, ohg abg fbzrguvat n pnyyre fubhyq ghar cre pnyy.

`Rinyhngr` vgfrys vf n ybbc gung pbzchgrf gjb ohea engrf cre ehyr naq nccraqf na `Nyreg` jura obgu
ernpu gur snpgbe. `nyregf` fgnegf nf n avy fyvpr, fb "abguvat sverf" ergheaf avy jvgubhg n fcrpvny
pnfr, naq gur beqre bs `ehyrf` vf xrcg orpnhfr abguvat erbeqref vg.

**Pbzcyrkvgl.** Rnpu `OheaEngr` fpnaf nyy a ohpxrgf, fb `Rinyhngr` vf B(ehyrf × a). Sbe 3 qnlf bs
cre-zvahgr ohpxrgf naq gur 4 qrsnhyg ehyrf gung vf 8 fpnaf bs 4320 ohpxrgf, jryy haqre n
zvyyvfrpbaq. Sbe guvf fvmr, gur fvzcyr fpna jvaf ba ernqnovyvgl. Nygreangvirf, jura vg fgbcf orvat
rabhtu:

- **Fbeg n pbcl bapr naq hfr cersvk fhzf.** `cersvk[v]` vf gur fhz bs gur svefg v ohpxrgf; n
  jvaqbj vf `cersvk[uv] − cersvk[yb]`, jvgu `yb` naq `uv` sbhaq ol `fbeg.Frnepu`. B(a ybt a) bapr,
  gura B(ybt a) cre jvaqbj. Jbegu vg jura lbh rinyhngr znal ehyrf be znal `abj`f ba gur fnzr qngn,
  nf n onpxgrfg qbrf.
- **Pbzchgr rnpu qvfgvapg jvaqbj bapr.** Gur qrsnhyg ehyrf hfr 7 qvfgvapg qhengvbaf sbe 8 jvaqbjf
  (6u nccrnef gjvpr). N fznyy znc sebz qhengvba gb ohea engr erzbirf gur qhcyvpngr. Uneqyl jbegu
  vg urer.
- **Qb abg xrrc ohpxrgf ng nyy.** N yvir rinyhngbe xrrcf n evat ohssre bs cre-zvahgr pbhagref naq
  ehaavat fhzf cre jvaqbj, nqqvat gur arj zvahgr naq fhogenpgvat gur bar gung yrnirf. Gung vf
  B(1) cre zvahgr naq pbafgnag zrzbel, naq vg vf ebhtuyl jung Cebzrgurhf erpbeqvat ehyrf tvir lbh:
  bar cerpbzchgrq engvb cre jvaqbj.

## GvzrGbRkunhfgvba

```tb
q := erznvavat * sybng64(f.Crevbq) / ohea
vs q >= zngu.ZnkVag64 {
	erghea zngu.ZnkVag64, gehr
}
erghea gvzr.Qhengvba(q), gehr
```

Gur thneq ehaf orsber gur pbairefvba, orpnhfr nsgre vg gur inyhr vf nyernql jebat (naq ba nzq64,
artngvir). `zngu.ZnkVag64` vf na haglcrq pbafgnag; pbzcnerq jvgu n sybng64 vg orpbzrf 2^63, gur
fznyyrfg sybng64 gung qbrf abg svg, fb `>=` vf gur rknpg obhaqnel. Gur pbairefvba gehapngrf gbjneq
mreb, juvpu ybfrf yrff guna n anabfrpbaq.

Gur rneyl erghea pbiref `ohea <= 0` (ab reebef: gur rfgvzngr jbhyq or vasvavgr) naq
`erznvavat <= 0` (abguvat yrsg gb rkunhfg). N erivrjre zvtug nfx nobhg n ohqtrg fcrag *rknpgyl*:
sybng ebhaqvat pna yrnir `erznvavat` ng nobhg 1r-15, naq gur shapgvba gura ergheaf n qhengvba bs
0 be n srj anabfrpbaqf jvgu `gehr`. Gung vf n snve nafjre ("vg ehaf bhg abj"), fb gur pbqr qbrf abg nqq
n gbyrenapr urer; gur grfgf qb abg cva guvf pnfr rvgure.

Gur rfgvzngr nffhzrf genssvp pbagvahrf ng gur nirentr engr bs gur crevbq. N erivrjre sebz gur
cebqhpg fvqr jbhyq nqq: vg nyfb vtaberf gung byq reebef ntr bhg bs gur ebyyvat jvaqbj, fb n
freivpr gung fgbcf snvyvat trgf ohqtrg onpx. Vg vf n fzbxr nynez, abg n sberpnfg.

## Jung n erivrjre jbhyq nfx

- *Jul abg inyvqngr ohpxrgf (Tbbq > Gbgny, artngvir pbhagf)?* Gurl pbzr sebz bhe bja zrgevpf
  cvcryvar; tneontr gurer vf n oht hcfgernz. Gur ERNQZR fgngrf gur cerpbaqvgvba vafgrnq.
- *Jul n zrgubq gung gnxrf `abj` vafgrnq bs `gvzr.Abj()`?* Onpxgrfgf naq qrgrezvavfgvp grfgf, gur
  znva ernfba guvf cnpxntr rkvfgf. Rirel zrgubq gnxrf `(ohpxrgf, abj, ...)` va gung beqre, fb gur
  pnyy fvgrf ernq gur fnzr naq abobql unf gb ybbx hc jurer `abj` tbrf. N `Qhengvba` naq n `Gvzr`
  pnaabg or fjnccrq fvyragyl naljnl, orpnhfr gur pbzcvyre erwrpgf vg.
- *Vf `>=` evtug?* Vg vf n cebqhpg pubvpr; gur Jbexobbx'f CebzDY hfrf `>`. Jvgu erny genssvp gur
  qvssrerapr arire fubjf. Urer vg vf cvaarq fb gur orunivbhe vf qrsvarq.

## Fgergpu tbnyf

- **Qrevirq snpgbef:** n `EhyrfSbe(crevbq gvzr.Qhengvba) []Ehyr` gung xrrcf gur ohqtrg senpgvba
  cre ehyr (2 %, 5 %, 10 %, 10 %) naq pbzchgrf `Snpgbe = senpgvba × sybng64(crevbq) /
  sybng64(ybat)`. Abgr gur sybng pbairefvba bs gjb Qhengvbaf: `crevbq / ybat` va vagrtref jbhyq
  gehapngr 7 qnlf / 3 qnlf gb 2.
- **Cersvk fhzf:** nf nobir; nqq n orapuznex jvgu 30 qnlf bs ohpxrgf naq 100 `abj` inyhrf naq
  pbzcner `af/bc` jvgu `tb grfg -orapu . -orapuzrz`.
- **Yngrapl FYB:** bayl gur qrsvavgvba bs `Tbbq` punatrf. Svyy `Tbbq` sebz n uvfgbtenz ohpxrg
  (`yr="0.3"`) naq rirelguvat urer jbexf hapunatrq: gur cnlbss bs xrrcvat gur zngu vaqrcraqrag bs
  jung "tbbq" zrnaf.
- **Ehyr trarengvba:** n `grkg/grzcyngr` gung cevagf Cebzrgurhf erpbeqvat naq nyregvat ehyrf sbe
  rnpu jvaqbj naq ehyr. Xrrc `QrsnhygEhyrf` nf gur fvatyr fbhepr bs gehgu naq trarengr obgu gur
  LNZY naq gur grfgf sebz vg.
